  "description": "<p>The task at hand is to address the following warnings in the fcrepo-auth-webac module.</p>\n\n<p>The fix will likely entail replacing any references to the deprecated method \"anyObject()\" with \"any()\".</p>\n\n<p>Once this issue is resolved when you build the module using this command</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nmvn clean install -pl fcrepo-auth-webac</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>the following warning should no longer appear in the output:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProviderTest.java:<span class=\"error\">&#91;128,38&#93;</span> &lt;T&gt;anyObject() in org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers has been deprecated<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProviderTest.java:<span class=\"error\">&#91;162,41&#93;</span> &lt;T&gt;anyObject() in org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers has been deprecated<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProviderTest.java:<span class=\"error\">&#91;195,41&#93;</span> &lt;T&gt;anyObject() in org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers has been deprecated<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProviderTest.java:<span class=\"error\">&#91;221,41&#93;</span> &lt;T&gt;anyObject() in org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers has been deprecated<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> /Users/danny/code/fcrepo4/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProviderTest.java:<span class=\"error\">&#91;246,41&#93;</span> &lt;T&gt;anyObject() in org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers has been deprecated<br/>\n<span class=